**Client / Site:** MG Moves

**Scope:** Accessibility Audit & Remediation

**Initial State:** 9 automated failures (6 serious and 3 moderate). Manual testing revealed navigation not receiving keyboard focus, missing bypass blocks, insufficient contrast ratios, critical reflow errors improper use of semantic markup.

**Remediation:** Authored a JavaScript focus-trap to handle reflow errors and updated codebase to correct all additional failures. \
